The Uttar Pradesh Pollution Control

00:05:56.500 --> 00:06:01.300 position:63%
Board that oversees Muzaffarnagar said
it fined nearly half of the more than 30

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:05.410 position:58%
mills in the city for burning plastic
and not managing the ash from their

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:07.450
milling process
just in October.

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:14.110 position:56%
Still, the problem isn't going away.


00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:28.120
 
The grandmother worries what the

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:30.320 position:59%
